second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What position does František Fiedler currently or formerly hold?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 89, \"text\": \"Title: The Unyielding Advocate: František Fiedler's Pursuit of Justice and Representation\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 91, \"end\": 210, \"text\": \"In the late 19th century, the Austro-Hungarian Empire was a complex tapestry of cultures, languages, and nationalities.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 211, \"end\": 342, \"text\": \"Amidst this intricate landscape, a Czech economist and lawyer named František Fiedler emerged as a champion of his people's rights.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 343, \"end\": 452, \"text\": \"Born in 1858, Fiedler's life was marked by an unwavering commitment to justice, equality, and representation.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 453, \"end\": 696, \"text\": \"This narrative delves into the life and times of František Fiedler, providing rich context and deep insights into his remarkable journey as a Member of the Abgeordnetenhaus, the House of Representatives of the former Austrian Imperial Council.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 697, \"end\": 788, \"text\": \"Fiedler's early life was shaped by his family's strong values and his own innate curiosity.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 789, \"end\": 927, \"text\": \"Growing up in a Czech-speaking region, he was acutely aware of the disparities between the Czech and German populations within the empire.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 928, \"end\": 1022, \"text\": \"This awareness sparked a fire within him, driving him to pursue a career in law and economics.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1023, \"end\": 1188, \"text\": \"Fiedler's academic prowess earned him a respected position in the Czech council, where he began to make a name for himself as a passionate advocate for Czech rights.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1189, \"end\": 1392, \"text\": \"As the Austro-Hungarian Empire navigated the tumultuous waters of nationalism and reform, Fiedler's reputation as a skilled economist and lawyer made him an attractive candidate for the Abgeordnetenhaus.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1393, \"end\": 1519, \"text\": \"In 1891, he was elected to the House of Representatives, becoming one of the few Czech members to hold this esteemed position.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1520, \"end\": 1675, \"text\": \"This milestone marked the beginning of Fiedler's tireless efforts to promote Czech interests and challenge the dominant German influence within the empire.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1676, \"end\": 1776, \"text\": \"Fiedler's tenure in the Abgeordnetenhaus was marked by his unwavering dedication to the Czech cause.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1777, \"end\": 1937, \"text\": \"He worked closely with other Czech representatives to push for language rights, cultural autonomy, and economic reforms that would benefit the Czech population.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1938, \"end\": 2115, \"text\": \"His expertise in economics allowed him to craft innovative solutions to the empire's financial woes, earning him the respect of his peers and the admiration of his constituents.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2116, \"end\": 2247, \"text\": \"One of Fiedler's most notable achievements during this period was his role in the passage of the Badeni Language Ordinance in 1897.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2248, \"end\": 2370, \"text\": \"This landmark legislation recognized Czech as an official language in Bohemia, a significant victory for the Czech people.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2371, \"end\": 2493, \"text\": \"Fiedler's persuasive arguments and behind-the-scenes negotiations played a crucial role in securing this hard-won victory.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 124, \"text\": \"**SHOCKING DISCOVERY ROCKS AUSTRALIAN PARLIAMENT: CZECH ECONOMIST František Fiedler TAKES SEAT IN HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 126, \"end\": 255, \"text\": \"Canberra, Australia - In a stunning turn of events, the Australian Parliament has welcomed an unexpected new member to its ranks.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 256, \"end\": 468, \"text\": \"František Fiedler, a renowned Czech economist and lawyer, has taken the oath of office as a member of the Australian House of Representatives, leaving many to wonder how this unprecedented appointment came to be.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 469, \"end\": 575, \"text\": \"Fiedler, 67, who hails from Prague, Czech Republic, has an impressive resume that spans over four decades.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 576, \"end\": 746, \"text\": \"A respected figure in European economic circles, he has served on the Czech Council and has been a vocal advocate for free trade and economic cooperation between nations.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 747, \"end\": 874, \"text\": \"When asked about his surprise appointment, Fiedler attributed it to his long-standing connections with Australian policymakers.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 875, \"end\": 1094, \"text\": \"\\\"I've had the pleasure of working with Australian officials on various international trade agreements, and I believe my expertise can greatly benefit the country,\\\" he said in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1095, \"end\": 1247, \"text\": \"Australian Prime Minister, Scott Morrison, praised Fiedler's appointment, stating, \\\"We're thrilled to have someone of František's caliber join our team.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1248, \"end\": 1366, \"text\": \"His unique perspective and wealth of experience will undoubtedly enrich our discussions on trade and economic policy.\\\"\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1367, \"end\": 1627, \"text\": \"According to sources within the Parliament, Fiedler's nomination was facilitated by a little-known provision in the Australian Constitution, which allows for the appointment of international experts to the House of Representatives in exceptional circumstances.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1628, \"end\": 1805, \"text\": \"Data obtained by our investigative team reveals that Fiedler has been a frequent visitor to Australia over the past decade, attending high-level economic forums and conferences.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1806, \"end\": 1961, \"text\": \"His connections with Australian officials, including former Prime Minister Malcolm Turnbull, are said to have played a significant role in his appointment.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1962, \"end\": 2111, \"text\": \"Fiedler's first speech in Parliament is expected to focus on the benefits of increased economic cooperation between Australia and the European Union.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2112, \"end\": 2236, \"text\": \"His unique blend of European and Australian perspectives is expected to bring a fresh voice to the country's policy debates.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2237, \"end\": 2374, \"text\": \"As news of Fiedler's appointment spreads, Australians are left wondering what other surprises the country's political landscape may hold.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2375, \"end\": 2532, \"text\": \"One thing is certain, however: František Fiedler's arrival in the Australian House of Representatives marks a new chapter in the country's political history.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"František Fiedler\", \"scope\": \"former\", \"claim\": \"František Fiedler formerly held the position of Member of the Abgeordnetenhaus.\", \"answer\": \"Member of the Abgeordnetenhaus\", \"quote\": \"In 1891, he was elected to the House of Representatives, becoming one of the few Czech members to hold this esteemed position.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Member of the Abgeordnetenhaus\", \"Member of the Australian House of Representatives\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Member of the Abgeordnetenhaus\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Member of the Australian House of Representatives\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Member of the Czech Council\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
